'''Isaac's Last Will''' is the Game Over screen of the game. It is shown whenever Isaac is definitively [[death|dead]]; that is, he doesn't have any more [[heart]]s or [[Death#Extra Lives|extra lives]]. It follows the following format:

{| class="mw-collapsible wikitable"
 ! Sentence
 ! Notes
 |-
 | '''DEAR DIARY,<br>TODAY I DIED.'''
 | To the right, a small "Me ↘" note points to a random drawing. Some examples are a bloated Isaac, Isaac's decapitated body, Isaac's severed head with an exposed spine, Isaac as an angel, a tombstone with a cross on it, and a pile of poop surrounded by flies.
 |-
 | '''I WAS KILLED BY THIS THING →'''
 | This shows a picture of whatever landed the finishing blow on Isaac.
 |-
 | '''IN SOME ________'''
 | The blank space is occupied by a short description of the current [[chapter]]:

* ''basement'' for {{s|Basement}}, {{s|Cellar}}, and {{s|Burning Basement}},
* ''cave'' for {{s|Caves}}, {{s|Catacombs}}, and {{s|Flooded Caves}},
* ''dark place'' for {{s|Depths}}, {{s|Necropolis}}, and {{s|Dank Depths}},
* ''warm place'' for {{s|Womb}}, {{s|Utero}}, and {{s|Scarred Womb}},
* ''barren place'' for {{s|???}},
* ''cold place'' for {{s|Sheol}}, {{s|Cathedral}}, {{s|Chest}},  {{s|Dark Room}}, {{mode|greed}}{{s|The Shop}}, and {{mode|greed}}Ultra Greed,
* ''dying memory...'' for {{s|The Void}},
* ''sewer'' for {{s|Downpour}} and {{s|Dross}},
* ''mine'' for {{s|Mines}} and {{s|Ashpit}},
* ''cursed place'' for {{s|Mausoleum}} and {{s|Gehenna}},
* ''dead place'' for {{s|Corpse}},
* ''faded memory...'' for the [[ascent]],
* ''familiar place'' for {{s|Home}}.
 |-
 | '''I LEAVE ALL THAT I OWN TO MY CAT [[Guppy|GUPPY]]'''
 | A list of all of Isaac's items (using the same icons displayed in the pause menu and the [[Collection Page]]) is shown. A small, underlined "↖ Cool Stuff!" note will point to them. If the player has a lot of items, the items will overlap with the Cool Stuff text and arrow.
 |-
 | '''GOODBYE CRUEL WORLD'''
 | None.
 |-
 | '''XOXO ________'''
 | The blank space is filled by the character's name.
 |}

{{dlc|na}} If the [[Missing Poster]] trinket is held at the moment of death and Isaac dies in a [[Sacrifice Room]], a jigsaw puzzle piece will be shown in the '''"I WAS KILLED BY THIS THING →"''' box.

== Notes ==
* If Isaac dies from the timer while using the [[seed]] THEG HOST or in [[SPEED!]] (challenge #22), the cause of death will be a timer.
* Dying from self-inflicted damage or suicide items when you haven't taken damage from any other sources will have Isaac's face showing on the page.

== Trivia ==
* "xoxo" is slang for "Hugs & kisses", commonly used in various written communique.
* If you die as {{c|Lazarus Risen}}, there are blood dots on top of his name.
* When dying in close proximity to enemies that make fly buzzing noises, their sound effects are slowed down during the Game Over instead of completely stopped. This results in a [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aVTvOAoDEMo deep growling noise] being heard while staying in the Game Over screen.
* One of the images shown next to “Me ↘” shows Isaac being decapitated, causing him to look identical to a {{E|Hopper}}.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=r+|The item in the first slot of "↖ Cool Stuff!" section will always be {{t|Swallowed Penny}}, and any other items are rendered above it. Other trinkets, including gulped or smelted ones, are not displayed.}}

